# Journey: scout sends the activity deck, and once a majority has sent picks
# (2 of 3), scout posts the plan without being asked or waiting on the rest: it
# schedules what the group shares and offers solo picks as add-ons. Picks sent
# later are saved without a second plan.
# Picks are counted in code; asking for the deck and the plan needs Claude.
members maya leo priya
from destination-chosen

maya: @scout what should we do while we're there?
expect state activity_deck.activities ~ "name"
maya: @scout my picks: 1 yeah, 3 yeah
expect scout reacted like
leo: @scout my picks: 1 yeah
expect scout ~ "the plan"
expect state itinerary_add_ons ~ "maya"
priya: @scout my picks: 1 yeah, 2 meh
expect scout reacted like
expect scout !~ "the plan"
